#
# THE PRINTED VERDICT OVERCLAIMS AND IS CORRECTED IN THE WRITE-UP: only ONE of
# the half-center's two ingredients was added. Matsuoka 1985 requires mutual
# inhibition between two populations AND adaptation; v32's lateral kernel is
# local-minus-field-mean, which is not reciprocal inhibition between two
# populations. So this refutes 'adaptation alone suffices here' -- which is what
# Matsuoka predicts anyway. The half-center itself remains UNTESTED.
